# GEO_Restock — folder-level WHITELIST .gitignore (2026-07-25)
# Model: ignore EVERYTHING by default, then bless specific folders back in.
# Anything inside a blessed folder commits automatically, including files that
# don't exist yet (e.g. a new part image, or a new MP3 dropped in Soundtrack).
# Surgical exclusions below handle junk/non-runtime items sitting inside a
# blessed folder. To add a whole new servable folder later, add one "!" line.

# --- ignore everything at the root ---
/*

# --- allow the two root config files back ---
!/.gitignore
!/netlify.toml

# --- BLESSED: the web app ---
!/Geo Restock APP Code/
#   surgical exclusions inside the app folder (non-runtime / local-only):
/Geo Restock APP Code/.claude/
/Geo Restock APP Code/Macbook Web Server.py
/Geo Restock APP Code/GeothermParts.json
/Geo Restock APP Code/GEO_Restock_Architecture.md

# --- BLESSED: part images + servable illustrations (NOT Images/UI) ---
!/Images/
/Images/*
!/Images/Parts/
!/Images/Illustrations/

# --- BLESSED: soundtrack (originals included, by design) ---
!/Soundtrack/

# --- junk, ignored everywhere including inside blessed folders ---
**/.DS_Store
